<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Bekwyel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Zak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Zak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zak</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛ Zak ɛ́ dhatyee mɛkana mɛ mot di ekwyɛl ɛsɛɛg ɛ bot étɛp ɛlɛɛ bɛ tɛp ɛ: yɛ ɛ́ <char style="em">mɛdjek</char> nɛghu tyee mbi <char style="em">ɛdjɛ mɛghaaz</char> nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ. Tin, Zak kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ, nɛ eYuda ee di edum koŋ nɛ Klisto ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ membyak mɛ eYuda ɛ́ si mɛtiŋ mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk ee di kɔ dik Lɔm ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ Zak ɛ́ dhatyee lɛŋ di edjɛ <char style="em">etsoŋ</char> ɛ. Ye ɛkwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́, dáa bot djas di edum koŋ nɛ Klisto ɔ, di egoka <char style="em">nɛ ɛkɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ</char>. É di'enek, bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, ɛpewaab etsoŋ binek pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Tin, Zɛɛb nɛ djɛ bɛ yɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:13-18">3.13-18</ref></char>). Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkakwak sa djas di ekwyɛl ɛpul mot ɛ: etɛp djas bɛ di eboma nɛ yɛ ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-4">1.2-4</ref></char>), ɛkwosak ɛdi mot ekuma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5.1-6</ref></char>), ɛkwosak ɛsa mot ɛbiyo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-18">1.2-18</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:1-9">4.1-9</ref></char>), ɛben ɛ nyel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:13-16">4.13-16</ref></char>). Mɛkana lyaal ɛ́ dáa ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb di epus mot nɛ ɛsa enɛm esa. Deenek, bot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi tɔ tɛtɛ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb mɛsa mak àànyen tɔ lɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2.14-26</ref></char>). Ɛsa deenek kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ, wɔ tiibal nɛ lyem'ɔ met, sa di biyo ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́, ɛbaadi nɛ lyem nɛ bɛsɔ bɔ, ɛsa mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di tɔ pwom ɔ, sa wɔ ààdi tetɛp kɔ bɛsɔ bɔ nɛghu ɛbee náá wɔ eedhaa bɛ, ɛpooko liig djem tɔ nuub esok ebá ɛsok nɛ ɛlóo ɛ́ mɛkpa mɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3.1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tin, ààbɛ nɛ mɛso, Zak kwyal wak ɛ́ nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:6">2.6</ref></char>). Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛdi nɛ ekuma, etɛɛ náá, elyem bɔɔ ɛ́ tɔ esa e bɔs. É di'enek, mɛkana waab nɛ nɔɔ ɛ náá, sa bɛ ààbyasal bɛdjel ɛ bot kɔ ɛsu ɛ pwom yɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Tin, mɛkana lɛɛ: Ekuma àànyɔ dum nɛ mbi sa bɛkum ɛ bot di esa nɛ yɛ ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5.1-6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Deenek, beeka sa zekwyaala tɔ ɛsik ɛ mɛkana di elɛɛ nɛ ekeletyɛ ɛ: kwyeeka bɛsɔ bin, djaalaka étɛp bɛsɔ bin, bulalka bot ɛ zedjɛl ɔ é ze.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Mam Zak, mot-mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto, mɛ eeswos membyak kam nɛ ebá<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">membyak kam nɛ ebá </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye lyaal wak ɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl zedum koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda di kɔ mɛdhik djas ɔ.</char></note>, di mɛdhik nɛ mɛdhik kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etsoŋ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, bi ɛ dhaa tɔ membi mɛ mɛbhowal djas ɔɔ, dika nɛ boo mɛmyaala. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Ɛtɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu, nɛghu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ kwak mɛbhowal, yɛ waadjɛ bin zii. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ zii, étɛp bi needi esosoob e bot, tin, sa sonok wat ààwyii tɔ len.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />É di'enek, mot ngɔt tɔ len ɛ́ di ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwaab yɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, deenek, Zɛɛb waadjɛ nyɛ etsoŋ. Ɛtɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb djɛ yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot djas ɛ nɛ bum lyem wat, tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Tin, é sok nyɛ di edjaala náá, Zɛɛb djɛ nyɛ dhiiti sonok ɛ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, sa nyɛ ààwa mɛso. Etɛɛ náá, mot di ewa mɛso ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dhatyee bhuuge dii pup di eghɛɛ, kɛghɛɛg yɛ é edi djas ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Deenek, sa kɔkɔ yenɔk mot ààgek náá, nyɛ waabela sonok pɛ daa Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛso tɔ lyem, nyɛ sa esonok bɛ djas ɛ́, nɛ elyem ebá.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edjel nɛ mɛvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɔn-nyɛɛg di tɔ edjel ɔ myaala, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛpedjɛ nyɛ mbɛɛ di mɛtaŋ. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Tin, mot ekum goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ mɛmyaala é sok Zɛɛb di esil nyɛ ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, dáa mɛzɛm mɛ mɛbhek di ààbɔya ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ mot ekum pe, nyɛ aanàbɔya. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Gwyes dyeebawyɛl ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛkas mɛ di esyes mɛbhek ɛ. Tin, zɛm ɛkwyit ɔɔ, enɛm bɛ djas eesi. Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat, nɛ dáa mot ekum aadiib nɛ ekum bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb ààwa mot tɔ mɛbhowal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Mɛmyaala nɛ mot di epyet ghiŋ tɔ mɛbhowal ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, mot aapyet ghiŋ tɔ mɛbhowal ɔ, nyɛ aabela kɔtɔ duu nɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm yii Zɛɛb nakɛk nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ kwyɛl nɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Tin, mot di tɔ mɛbhowal ɔ, sa nyɛ ààke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ di ebowal mɛ.» Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbela geka ɛbowal ɛ́ mot, nɛghu ɛpus ɛ mot tɔ ɛbiyo. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Tin, mbee ɛkwosak ɛ mot nɛ mot ɛ di edul mot tɔ embee etɛp. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />É di'enek, wɔ bet náá, ɛkwosak ɛ tak dhaa wɔ ghwyil ɔ, ye kadul wɔ ɛ́ tɔ esyem. Bhii tak, wɔ dyeebagyee tɔ esyem ɔɔ, ye kadul wɔ ɛ́ tɔ ɛsyee. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, nàkɔɔka mɛnyel men. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Embɛɛ esonok djas bot di bela ɛ, nɛ mbɛɛ mɛkɛɛ djas bot di ebela ɛ dus ɛ́ tɔ gwoo, ye dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb, kusel esa e mɛkas djas di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Pɛ tɔ lɛ, ye tok nɛ zwoola, ààbɛ-bɛak nɛ kyee wat di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mɛghomela. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Nyɛy nyɛ met ɛ nakwyɛl ɛdjɛ bis tsik'ɛ nɛ mɛkpa mɛ na tsɛɛtsɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bis needi bot ɛsok tɔ esa djas ee nyɛ nakus ɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛgwak ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛkɛ dáa ye di elɛɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛmɛt ɛnyɔɛpe sa mɛ di elɛɛ bin'aak: Mot nɛ mot kwyɛs nɛ ɛgwak. Yɛ ààgoka náá, mot kwyɛs ɛlii, nɛ ɛkwyɛs nɛ ɛbela ɛbuk. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Etɛɛ náá, é sok mot di nɛ ɛbuk ɛ, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkɛ tɔ epiki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Deenek, mwaska mendi nɛ embee mɛsa men djas di ezyɛ tɔ ɛbuk ɛ. Myaalka nɛ mɛsila djas, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di ebɛ, tyee bhek tɔ ebhum elyem bin ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi neebela tsik.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Nàkɔɔka mɛnyel men, ye goka ɛ́ náá, é sok bi di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkɛ tyee mɛkpa mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Etɛɛ náá, mot di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, da nyɛ kadi ààkɛ tyee mɛkpa mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ dhatyee mot di ebee ɛbhwoob ɛ lɛ tɔ ɛnyen ɛ. Nyɛ zobee ɛ́ dáa nyɛ di ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Bhii tak, dáa nyɛ bee ɛbhwoob ɛ lɛ, é ɛwala ɛlenek, nyɛ eetɔ́, djisa dáa ɛbhwoob ɛ lɛ di ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Bela náá, mot ɛ gwak nɛ ɛsiiza ɛsuk ɛ tɛtɛ etsi e Zɛɛb di epɛk bot ɔɔ, mot tak ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ esosoob ɔɔ, ààbɛ náá, nyɛ gwak ɛ́ étɛp nyɛ neeghisa yɛ djɛmɛn ɔ, tin, nyɛ kɛ tyee mɛkpa mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɔ. Mbi yenɔk mot aadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala dum nɛ esa djas nyɛ di esa ɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Mot ɛ ke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot di edjaala Zɛɛb ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, bela náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot di ekwyɛs nuub ɔɔ, nyɛ eekɔɔ nyel'ɛ, mendjaala mɛ ɛ́ toto. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Beeka tɛtɛ mbi mendjaala Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena di emyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ: Ɛkwyee bɔn nyel nɛ bɛkus ɛ boa tɔ mezuk mɔɔ, nɛ ɛbaabaal nyel tɔ embee esonok djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Nàwaka mbɛk pak bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, biyɔ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ na duu yenaka Yezu Klisto ɔ, bi ààgoka náá, bi wa mbɛk pak bot. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Djhoopookonɔɔka geka yak: Kuma mot eeni tɔ zɛɛga yen nɛ ewolo ekaad é nyel, nɛ ɛsum ɛ nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ é djin. Tin, dhiiti djel mot eebaazɛni nɛ enyaŋela ekaad é nyel. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Bi kaduwal ɛ́ mot nabɔt ewolo ekaad ɔ, bi kake nɛ nɛ náá: «Beea tɛtɛ di di egoka nɛ nɔ, dia si.» Bi kake nɛ djel mot ɛ́ náá: «Wɔy, tyaŋa tetel, nɛghu dia si é bɔs é di mɛ kɛl mɛko mam ɔ!» <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Tin, é ghɛŋ bi di esa deenek ɛ, bi ààpabee náá, bi ɛpewa mbɛk pak'en é? É di'enek, bi kadi ɛ́ bɛmbee bɛtetɛp ɛ na mbee esiiza.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam gwakeka mɛ, Zɛɛb eezesɛ́ɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot é mis mɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak. Nyɛ nasɛ́ɛ bɛ ɛ́, étɛp bɛ needi bɛkum ɛ bot, kɔ ɛsu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ neebela Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nakɛk nɛ bot ɛ di kwyɛl nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Tin, biyɔ ɛpepul dék bɛdjel ɛ bot. Ye tok bɛkum ɛ bot di etiig bin é? Ye tok bɔɔ di edul bin nɛ bhel sok bhwoob bɛtetɛp é? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Yɛ ɛ́ bɛkum ɛ bot ɛ di elee nɛ ɛnyɛk mbɛɛ din ɛ Klisto yii Zɛɛb djɛ bin ɛ.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Tin, Ekwyala Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Kwyɛla sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di kwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:18">Mɛs 19.18</ref></char></note>.» Yɛ ɛ́ tin ɛ́ etsi e Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, deenek, bi ɛ́ looba nɛ yɛ ɔɔ, bi eesa ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Tin, bi ɛ wa mbɛk pak bot ɔɔ, guka náá, bi eesyem é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. É di'enek, tsi yenek eekwyesal bin ndjɛ sɔs, etɛɛ náá, bi ààpalooba nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Mot di eduwal etsi e Zɛɛb djas, bhii tak, nyɛ kadi ɛ́ ààbaal wat tɔ sama etsi tak ɔɔ, deenek, mot tak ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ é etsi djas. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nake náá: «Sa mot ààsa mɛzɔ», yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ nabaazoke náá: «Sa mot ààgó sɔ mot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ɛwy 20.14</ref></char> nɛ tɔ<char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:18">Dɛt 5.18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ɛwy 20.13</ref></char> nɛ tɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:17">Dɛt 5.17</ref></char>.</char></note>.» Tin, wɔ gó sɔ'ɔ mot ɔɔ, ye nakoozodi náá, wɔ duwal ɛ́ tsi mɛzɔ, gua náá, wɔ ààpaduwal etsi. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Tin, bi goka nɛ ɛlii, nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ́, dáa bot ɛ di egu náá, bɛ waapɛ́ɛaa nɛ etsi ee di enɛɛg bot pɛka ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Guka náá, é ghɛŋ Zɛɛb aapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, nyɛ aanàkwaagek ghoŋ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ààgek bɛsɔ bɔɔ ghoŋ ɔ. Tin, mot di egek bɛsɔ bɛ ghoŋ ɔ, nyɛ aanàdi nɛ bwoo nɛ epɛ́ɛ e Zɛɛb.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛsa nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp yé mot aake náá: «Mɛ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb», nyɛ ɛ di ààtel yɛ tɔ mɛsa ɔɔ? Kɔkɔ mbi yenek ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik nyɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, bɔn-nyɛɛg bin tɔ Yezu Klisto tok nɛ kaad ɛbɔt, ààbɛ nɛ sa dek mɛlu djas ɔɔ, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />bi ɛ di ààdjɛ bɛ esa ee di egoka nɛ tsik ɔɔ, étɛp yé bi di elɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka tɔ egwyem, betka mɛnyel men ɛnyɔɛpe, da bi ɛ́ dɛ djil»? Yɛ ɛ́ yii toto. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ tɛp ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Embɛɛ mɛsa ɛ di ààkɛ lɔɔg wat nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, yenek djas ɛ́ toto.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke náá: «Wɔy ɛ́ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, mam nɛ embɛɛ mɛsa!» Mɛ waabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlyaal mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Klisto, dhi wɔy ààbɛ nɛ embɛɛ mɛsa? Tin, mam ɛ́ waalyaal wɔ ɛdum koŋ ɛ lam tɔ embɛɛ mɛsa mam.» <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Wɔ nɛ myaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ ngɔt é? Deenek, dɔɔ nɛ embee esisim pe nɛ baamyaal yɛ, bela náá, bɛ nɛ pwak nɛ bwoo. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ egeka tɔ mɛsel mɔ? Wɔ ɛ́ ɛpekwyɛl ɛbee esa ee di elyaal náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ di àànyen tɔ mɛsa ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ yii toto? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Bhaab yenaka Abalaam nasa dáa, nyɛ neebela di ɛdi mot epiki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ embɛɛ mɛsa mɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ é sok nyɛ nanɔɔ mɔn'ɛ Izak, ka nyɛ buwa kɔ mesa-ebuwa ɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Wɔ eebee nyɛ, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb nadi ekɛ ɛ́ sama nɛ mɛsa mɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ di elyaal etsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ eedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Tin, sa Ekwyala e Zɛɛb di elɛɛ eebela ɛsuk: «Abalaam naadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Zɛɛb naadjɛ nyɛ di epiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Mɛk 15.6</ref></char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nɛ tɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Eza 41.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:7">Dh2 20.7</ref></char>.</char></note>.» Tin ɛ́ Zɛɛb nadjóo nyɛ sɔ'ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Bi eebee biyɔ bɛmet náá, Zɛɛb bee mot piki ɛ́, dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ di esa ɛ, ààkabɛ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ toto.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Dhiiti geka ɛ́ náá, ye nazobaasael ɛ́ deenek nɛ moma mɛzɔ nadi edjóoaa Layaab ɛ. Nyɛ naabeeaa piki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ, bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl nalwom sok náá, bɛ kɛbala dɛl ɔ, nazɛsulal ɛ́ pɛ daa lɛ. Tin, nyɛ naabaazɛkwyee bɛ nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ bɛ mbɛɛ ze bɛ aasik é tak ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Tin, tyee wat nɛ, nyel mot, yɛ di ààbɛ nɛ eswos ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ muu, deenek yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ, yɛ di àànyen tɔ mɛsa ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ yii toto.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Mɛbwala mɛ djem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, sa biyɔ djas ààsaa náá, bi needi bɛlyoel. Etɛɛ náá, bisɔ bɛlyoel aapɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe dhaa bot djas.<verse eid="JAS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Menabɛlka djas nɛ bu ɛdjak. Tin, mot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ɛdjak tɔ lii yɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ piki mot, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu ɛdil ɛ nyel'ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ é ghɛŋ mena di ewaka mɔɔ gwooz tɔ nuub eyaaga étɛp bɛ neelooba nɛ nena ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ, mena di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛɛd mɛnyel mɔɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="La chose qu’on attache à la gueule d’un cheval pour lui guider" file="WA04016b.tif" size="col" loc="3.3" copy="Graham Wade" ref="3.3">Sa bɛ di etiŋal yaaga é nuub ɛ, étɛp ɛpem nyɛ ɛ</figure><verse eid="JAS 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Yɛ ɛ́ dhatyee elɛɛd, ye nakoozobɔk dáa, boo pup ɛ di etiidal yɛ. Tin, ye kadi ɛ́ ba mɔɔ wul ɛ di edjɛɛd yɛ, ye kadu-du ɛ́ pɛ kyee mot di ebe yɛ ɔ di epem ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ djem, Yɛ ɛ́ mɔɔ kyes ɛtɔɔlɛpe é nyel mot, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdiig bet náá, yɛ waasa eboo etɛp.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Beeka: mɔɔ du ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, boo dik dyak djas. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek, djem ɛ́ dáa du. Yɛ ɛ́, di embee esesɛɛ dyeebadi ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ ba mɔɔ kyes ɛtɔɔlɛpe é nyel mot, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpul tu nyel mot. Djem mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdik tsik mot, kana ɛbyel ɛ lɛ nɛ kɛkum dwoo ɛsyee ɛ lɛ. Du tak dus ɛ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm di ààdim ɛ.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Mot ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, bɛtit ɛ dik djas, bɛsu, enen dɔɔ nɛ bɛnyɔ looba nɛ nɛ. Tin, nyɛ naazesa náá, nyɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛɛd bɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Yɛ kabɛ djem ɔɔ, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛɛd yɛ. Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mbee sonok di ààdi gwyem ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ nea di egó bot ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Mena duwal Ghɛŋ Sɛɛg'enaka ɛ́ nɛ edjem bina. Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ djem tak wat ɛ, mena di ebaakal bot ɛ Zɛɛb nakus, di enɔŋel nɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Tin, mɛkpa mɛ duu nɛ ekɛlok zodus ɛ́ tɔ nuub tak wat. Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, yɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ye tok nɛ sɔɔgɔ wat di edjɛ tɛtɛ mɛdii nɛ ɛ́ baadjɛ mɛdii mɛ na gwyee-gwyee. <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, le fiigh tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ́ ɛdjɛ bhum zaboka. Kel sɛŋ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ́ ɛdjɛ bhum fiigh. Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat, sɔɔgɔ di ewyisal mɛdii mɛ di egwom ɛ, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbaawyisal tɛtɛ mɛdii.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etsoŋ ee di edus pɛ ɛko ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Dhiiti mot pak'en ɛpegek náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ etsoŋ nɛ mɛtselal é? Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ goka nɛ ɛtel yɛ ɛ́, tɔ mɛsa mɛ ghwyikwyee, nɛ tɔ mɛsila mɛ nyel nɛ etsoŋ. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Tin, bi ɛ di nɛ bhyen, ààbɛ nɛ lyem ɛ ɛgwakel ɔɔ, betka ɛghɛɛ mɛnyel, etɛɛ náá, bi ààlɛɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Kwaambi yenek etsoŋ ààdus pɛ ɛko, yɛ ɛ́ etɛp e bot ɛ bɔs'ak, yii bot ɛ epuud, yɛ ɛ́ yii Satan. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />É di bhyen nɛ mbee lyem di ɔ, tin, bi ɛ́ waabaabela ɛzɛm nɛ ekɔkɔ e mbee etɛp djas.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Tin, etsoŋ ee di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ, pookodi sok ɛ́ dɛɛ. Bhii tak etsoŋ e tak kadjɛ ɛ́ mɛtela mɛ lyem, egwyem nɛ ɛgu ɛlii, nyɛ nɛ gek bɔɔ bɛsɔ ghoŋ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ bu enɛm nɛ embɛɛ. Nyɛ ààsa mbɛk pak bot, nyɛ ààgu mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Bot ɛ di ewa egwyem pak'ɔɔ, bɛ ɛ́ dáa bot ɛ di ebɛ see ɔ. Deenek, bot ɛ tak ɛ́ waabɔ́k bhum, bhum tak ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ epiki.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Kwyɛl esa e bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Mɛwɔ nɛ ezyaala dus wo pak'en? Ye dus ɛ́ tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ di eswak tɔ mɛnyel men ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Bi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛbela dhiiti sonok, tin, bi ààbela yɛ. Ye kalwom bin ɛ́ náá, bi gó mot. Bi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes dhiiti sonok, tin, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbela yɛ. Ye kalwom bin ɛ́, bi di tɔ mɛwɔ nɛ ezyaala pak'en. É di'enek, bi ɛ di ààbela sa bi di ekwyɛl ɛwaab ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu ɛwaab ɛ yɛ pɛ daa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />É sok bi di ewaab dhiiti sonok nɛ Zɛɛb, da bi kadi ɛ́ ààbela ɛ, yɛ ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ embee mɛgham. Esonok bi di ewaab nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛsa mɛkwosak mɛ elyem bin. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Biyɔ bot ɛ mɛzɔ, bi ààgu náá, ɛkwyɛl ɛ esa e bɔs saŋ ɛ́ náá, bi di bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Zɛɛb é? Tin, guka náá, mot di ekwyɛl esa e bɔs'ak ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot mɛbhuka ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Deenek, sa bi ààgek náá, yɛ ɛ́ yii toto, sa Ekwyala e Zɛɛb di elɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl Sisim nyɛ nawa tɔ les ɛ ɛbuɛpe.» <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Tin, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ee Zɛɛb sa nɛ nes ɛ eedhaa mɛbu. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala e Zɛɛb nɛ baalɛɛ náá: «Zɛɛb nɛ byen bot ɛ ɛghɛɛ nyel, tin, nyɛ sa enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ ɛ nɛ bot ɛ di etela ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Eka 3.34</ref></char>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Tin, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ Zɛɛb, da bi ɛ́ byen esesɛɛ e dim mot mɛkɔŋ, nyɛ waakaab tɔ́ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nen. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Kunaaka nɛ Zɛɛb, tin, nyɛ aakunaa nɛ nen. Biyɔ bot ɛ mesyem, gwyiika mɛmbɔ men, diska edhuud e ebhum elyem bin, biyɔ bot mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Dika tɔ ghoŋ, djeka, bɔtka ekaad e ɛpum. Tin, egɔ bin waaliiza mɛgwyɛ, mɛmyaala men ɛ́ waaliiza ghoŋ. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Dika nɛ mɛsila é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ, tin, nyɛ waadjɛ bin duu.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa mot ààpɛ́ɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, sa mot ààpɛ́ɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg. Etɛɛ náá, mot di ebyak mɔn-nyɛɛg, nɛghu ɛpɛ́ɛ nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ byak ɛ́ etsi e Zɛɛb. Deenek, nyɛ pɛ́ɛ ɛ́ etsi e Zɛɛb. É di'enek, wɔ kasaŋ ɛ́ náá, wɔ di tetɛp etsi e Zɛɛb. Wɔ ààpakasaa náá, wɔ kɛ dáa etsi di elɛɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Tin, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet mot di edjɛ etsi, nyɛy mot di egoka nɛ ɛpɛ́ɛ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ di egó nɛ ɛtsik ɛ́ bot. Wɔ bee tin náá, wɔ moo zɛ, wɔy mot di epɛ́ɛ mɔn-nyoog ɔ?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa mot ààdi nɛ ɛghɛɛ nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Gwakeka mɛ, biyɔ bot ɛ di eke náá: «Bis ɛpetɔ́ bɛdjoŋ mos, nɛghu djɛmɛn pɛ dhiiti ghaada sis, kɛsa tu mbu, étɛp ɛkɛbɔmsa esa, tin bot waabela epata» ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Ghuna bi ààgu sa aasa bin djɛmɛn ɛ. Bi ɛ́ tin ɛ́, dáa ba bɔɔ eguud di ewyis, ààbɔya batsa, yɛ ɛ́ diib ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Gwakeka etɛp ee bi di egoka nɛ ɛke ɛ́: «Ghɛŋ ɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ, mena dika nɛ tsik ɔɔ, deenek, mena aasaka tɛp sis, tɛp kɛl.» <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Tin, guka náá, bi nɛ kwyɛl ɛghɛɛ mɛnyel nɛ ɛbet. Mbi mɛfulu menek àànyɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mot di egu ɛsa mɛnyɔ, nyɛ kadi ɛ́ ààsa yɛ ɔɔ, mot yenɔk ɛ́ tɔ mesyem.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛdul ɛ bot ɛ mɛvu mɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Gwakeka mɛ, biyɔ bot ɛ mɛvu, djeka, simka, etɛɛ náá, mezuk ɛ́ waazyɛ kɔ len! <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Mɛvu men eezepulel, bɛsɛs eezegɔɔ bin ekaad. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Elɔɔd bin nɛ epata bin moo ɛ́ nɛ emaa. Emaa e tak ɛ́ waagɔɔ bin mɛnyel nɛ ɛbaapit bin, yɛ waadik bin dáa du. Bɔs moo ɛ́ pɛ mɛsik, biyɔ bot ɛ di ekwom bɛtɛ nɛ mɛvu ɔ! <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Bi eebyen ɛdjɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ epyeeb bin efute bɔɔ. Deenek, bɛ ɛpetsim, guka náá, etsim e bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ tak eekum tɔ mɛlɔ ɛ Zɛɛb, Ghɛŋ Sabhaɔt. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Pɛ kɔ bɔs, bi di ɛ́ tɔ mɛnyɔ nɛ mɛvu, mɛnyel men moo ɛ́ nɛ mɛdɛl dáa bɛtit ɛ di kɛtsakaa ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Bi naazekwyesal bot ɛ epiki ndjɛ sɔs nɛ ɛgó bɛ. Bɛ ààpakopapela-papelak, bɛ naadjɛ bin mɛnyel.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhwood ɛzyɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ nɛ ɛbwaalel djas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, dika nɛ zii nɛ bhwood kɛkum dwoo Ghɛŋ aabula ɛ. Beeka dáa mbɛel mɛbhek di nɛ ɛbwaalel é ɛbwood náá, bɛbhi pookokan ɛnee nɛ ɛsi, étɛp bɔs needjɛ nyɛ mbɛɛ mɛbhek ɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Tin, ye goka ɛ́, bi di tɔ zii nɛ bhwood, nɛ mɛghaaz etɛɛ náá, ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ eezekunaa.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, nàlɛkaka pak'en, Zɛɛb ɛzɛkɛpɛ́ɛ bin. Tetɛp moo aakum, nyɛ moo ɛ́, é ɛniel ɛ ndjaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, taalaka nɛ etɛp bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalii kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ: bɛ di nɛ nen dáa geka ɛmaad ɛ lyem nɛ esosoob tɔ mezuk. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Mena djóoka bɛ bot ɛ mɛmyaala ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadyeebapyet. Bi naagwak sesa ɛ Zɔɔb, dáa nyɛ namaad mezuk tɔ zii é bhwood ɛ. Bi nɛ gu dáa Ghɛŋ nasa nyɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bhii tak ɛ. Tin, Ghɛŋ nɛ nyɔ, nyɛ nɛ gek bot ɛ di tɔ mezuk ɔ ghoŋ.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, guka náá, sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ kɔ esa ee di tɔ gwoo, nɛghu kɔ bɔs ɛ. Tin, ààkotuwal yɛ dhiiti mbi ɛtuwal. Deenek, bi aazomyaal ɛ «<char style="em">heee</char>», yɛ bɛ náá yɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ. Nɛghu «ààbɛ», yɛ bɛ náá, ye tok deenek ɔɔ, étɛp ɛkaab náá, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛbela ndjɛ sɔs é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot tɔ len di tɔ mezuk é? Nyɛ ni tɔ mendjaala. Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot tɔ len di nɛ mɛmyaala? Nyɛ tii mɛdjeeb mɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Mot ngɔt ɛpebɛ́ tɔ len é? Deenek, nyɛ djóo bɛpaa ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala, bɛ djaala étɛp nyɛ neetsak, da bɛ ɛ́ so nyɛ mul kɔ lo nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Tin, mendjaala di esael tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik mot ɛbɛ́. Yɛ bɛ náá, mot tak naasa mesyem ɔɔ, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waapel nyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Vaaka mesyem men pak'en, tin da bi ɛ́ djedjaala pak'en, étɛp bi neetsak. Mendjaala mɛ mot epiki ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛbwala dhaatsɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Eli, nazobɛ ɛ́ mot dáa menabɛlka. Nyɛ naadjaala ɛbuɛpe etɛɛ náá, bhi needi àànee. Mendjaala mɛ naazɛsa náá, bhi di àànɔ kɔ bɔs membu melɛl nɛ pes. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Bhii tak, nyɛ naabaazɛdjaala-djaala sis. Tin, gwoo naasil mɛdhii mɛ bhi, bhii tak, bɔs naazɛdjɛ mɛbhek.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, mot ngɔt tɔ len ɛ bɛka nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mot ngɔt bulal nyɛ é ze. <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />Guka náá: Mot di dis mot mesyem tɔ mbee ze nyɛ natɔ́ ɛ, nyɛ eedis nyɛ tɔ ɛsyee. É di'enek Zɛɛb ɛ́ waapel zukamwaa nɛ mesyem mɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>